CanvasView::marks holds proposals, warnings, errors, overrides and change
marks. marks::layout places them in screen space: glyphs at the top-right
(problems) or top-left (overrides) of the object's ink, clustering into a
count when zoomed out; dashed outlines for proposals and removed ghosts,
solid ones for added and modified. The widget paints them over the drawing
and its text, shows the hint on the nearest proposal only and a note for
the glyph under the cursor (CanvasOutput::hovered_marks). Marks::hidden is
Shift+P, Marks::show_overrides is Shift+O held. Selection is now a 2 px mark.

